00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The requirement to cooking Marriott Badge 1C has been revised. to read:

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Wild Game will be used in this requirement,

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Caught using methods shown in the updated version of the Wilderness Survival Marriott Badge,

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Or maybe picked up off the road in accordance with local laws.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
